{"id": "biz-2", "headline": "Roche touts breast cancer pill after two FDA nods", "source": "STAT News", "url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/24/biotech-news-roche-potential-breast-cancer-blockbluster-drug-wins-second-fda-nod/", "published": "2026-11-24", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Roche is promoting the blockbuster potential of a new breast cancer pill after winning two US regulatory approvals within a week, according to Bloomberg as relayed by STAT. The medicine, called Wilserdly, is central to the drugmaker's plan to regain its footing in the fast-growing cancer market. Roche is positioning it to replace decades-old hormone therapies that patients take for years to reduce the risk of recurrence. Analysts estimate peak annual sales at about $9 billion, roughly in line with the company's own expectations. A second approval widens the group of patients who can receive the drug. Source: STAT News."], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110011010001011000100100101101111111", "10000010110000010000101001110000101000001", "10111010000100111011011010100010101011101", "10111010100000010110001111010100001011101", "10111010010000111111100100001001101011101", "10000010101000100000101001111100001000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000010010101001111110011001000000000", "11111011100001101101101011011100010101010", "10001001111111001101101101000001101111001", "01010110111011111100101010110000010100000", "00010101101101001001110110110001111111001", "10100110000100101010001011111101010101110", "11000101110011010011110101101001111111001", "01111010110001111110011001110110100110000", "11111001001010010011110000100001001110010", "10011110111001110101101011011111010100100", "01011000111100101011110100100011111110001", "00001010010010010010111001110110001100000", "10110000100110110010110100100000100111000", "10010011101010010010000111111100000001110", "10001001110000111111110100001101111111101", "01001111000110100100111000010100101101000", "10011100110100001